"use strict";(self.webpackChunk_N_E=self.webpackChunk_N_E||[]).push([[10332],{10332:function(e){e.exports=JSON.parse('{"content":"\\n<center>\\n<RestaurantCard\\n  cover=\\"/assets/snippets/location/8266fde0b459d4febbe4844853f0b556.jpg\\"\\n  title=\\"Smith at Home\\"\\n  cuisine=\\"Cafe\\"\\n  address=\\"20-2 Gurak-ro 43-beon-gil, Suyeong-gu, Busan\\"\\n  rating=4\\n  tags=\\"cafe\\"\\n/>\\n</center>\\n\\n## Review\\nI visited after receiving a recommendation from YouTube.  \\nI was going to drink coffee, but personally, I don\'t prefer coffee with acidity, so I ordered <mark>Handmade Ginger Tea</mark> and <mark>Iced Milk Tea</mark>.  \\n\\nI like warm healthy tea and was wondering what to drink, when the owner recommended the ginger tea they made themselves, so I ordered it without hesitation.  \\n\\nFortunately, there was some <mark>Cr\xe8me Br\xfbl\xe9e</mark> (limited quantity) left, so I ordered it too.  \\n\\n<mark>Handmade Ginger Tea</mark> doesn\'t have a very strong ginger scent; it spreads subtly.  \\nHowever, it was a bit disappointing that the sweetness was stronger than expected and the ginger scent was weak.  \\n\\nThe <mark>Iced Milk Tea</mark> was also sweeter than expected, so it didn\'t go well with the <mark>Cr\xe8me Br\xfbl\xe9e</mark>.  \\nI thought maybe I should have ordered an Iced Americano after all.  \\n\\nBut it was a good experience to try new drinks in an unfamiliar place.  \\n\\nThe atmosphere is nice and the owner is friendly, so I plan to visit again if I have the chance.   \\n## Pictures\\n<pictures>\\n<img src=\\"/assets/snippets/location/27a8a75d39730ce1bd5e365f481e0c38.jpg\\" style=\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; object-fit: contain;\\" alt=\\"Smith at Home\\">\\n<img src=\\"/assets/snippets/location/99cb1b5b5f925cf1a62a78ec43433bd9.jpg\\" style=\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; object-fit: contain;\\" alt=\\"Smith at Home\\">\\n</pictures>\\n"}')}}]);